Let  $M$  be the Miquel point of the complete quadrilateral determined by  $AB,BC,CA$  and  $\ell$ .**Claim 3.**  $AP_bP_cD$  and cyclic variations.

*Proof.* Angle chasing, we have  $$ \measuredangle P_bDP_c=\measuredangle P_bDP+\measuredangle PDP_c=\measuredangle AP_bP+\measuredangle PP_cA=\measuredangle P_bAP_c, $$  as desired.**Claim 4.**  $DEFM$  is cyclic.

